[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4666903187","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120116#issuecomment-4666903187","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120116","id":4666903187,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFitKkw","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T05:35:52Z","updated_at":"2026-06-10T05:35:52Z","body":"> but this PR causes inconsistencies in the calculation of vertical height during line breaks by making it dependent on the presence of characters on the line.\r\n\r\nThis is exactly as was before the https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119987, but seems like editor docs and probably other stuff relay on this behavior.\r\n\r\n> The Tab indent regression https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120103 definitely needs to be fixed\r\n\r\nThis PR will not fix any part of #120103 there's https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120104 for it (or https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119987 can be fully reverted, but this will bring back the other issue). ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4666903187/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4667053933","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120116#issuecomment-4667053933","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120116","id":4667053933,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFi2XbQ","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-10T06:01:29Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T01:58:18Z","body":"As I mentioned in my previous comment, shouldn’t we fix the inconsistency in how the height of text consisting solely of line breaks is calculated? I assume this PR is intended to ignore the height of the last line, but in the case of `/n/n`, the height of three lines is being calculated (if you ignore the last line break, it should be x2, not x3).\r\n\r\nI believe https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120115 relies on the behavior of ignoring the final line break. However are there any cases where it relies on the behavior of \"not\" ignoring the final line break when the line consists only of a blank line?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4667053933/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4686639881","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120116#issuecomment-4686639881","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120116","id":4686639881,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABF1hzCQ","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-12T01:55:49Z","updated_at":"2026-06-12T01:56:19Z","body":"For now, I think that we should approve merging this PR to maintain the current status for 4.7. However, from 4.8 onwards, we should fix t